   "m_category": "Mock GPS Follow Live Nav(example)",
   "m_completed": true,
   "m_constraintList": [],
   "m_description": "Serialize each flat typed StopData dictionary with lvjson, then append it to JSON_Body. MacroDroid 5.54+. Initial location must be latitude,longitude. Set local g_server_url to the PC Tailscale URL (port 5050), set API-ACCESS-KEY, then enable this macro. HTTP_Code 202 means accepted; 400 means invalid request. HTTP_Code 0 is not a successful HTTP response.",
