   "m_completed": true,
   "m_constraintList": [],
   "m_description": "Enable this macro to receive /gps?lat=...&lng=... into http_params and forward coordinates to GPS JoyStick. Verify the phone HTTP server listens on port 8080. Set PHONE_TAILSCALE_IP on the PC to this phone current Tailscale IP. Keep Tailscale and MacroDroid running. A connect timeout occurs before this trigger receives the request; importing this category alone cannot configure phone networking or battery settings.",
